          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The shape of a diamond plays a key role in its visual identity — not just how it looks on the hand, but how it interacts with light. From timeless silhouettes to more contemporary forms, each shape offers its own character and style. It’s a deeply personal choice, often guided by instinct as much as taste. Explore the cuts below to get a feel for what resonates with you.</p>",
