        "show_space": false,
        "code": "<style>\n  .diamond-tabs-section {\n    max-width: 800px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 2rem 1rem;\n  }\n\n  .tab-item {\n    border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n  }\n\n  .tab-header {\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    padding: 1rem 0;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .tab-header::after {\n    content: '+';\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\n  }\n\n  .tab-header.active::after {\n    content: '-';\n  }\n\n  .tab-content {\n    display: none;\n    padding: 1rem 0;\n  }\n\n  .tab-content img {\n    max-width: 100%;\n    height: auto;\n    margin-top: 1rem;\n    border-radius: 0.5rem;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"diamond-tabs-section\">\n  <div class=\"tab-item\">\n    <div class=\"tab-header\">Round Brilliant</div>\n    <div class=\"tab-content\">\n      <p>The most timeless of all cuts, the round brilliant is prized for its incredible sparkle and balance. Its symmetrical shape and 58 facets maximise light return, making it a favourite for engagement rings and classic designs.</p>\n      <img src=\"{{ 'round-brilliant.jpg' | asset_url }}\" alt=\"Round Brilliant Diamond\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"tab-item\">\n    <div class=\"tab-header\">Oval</div>\n    <div class=\"tab-content\">\n      <p>Elegant and elongating, the oval cut offers a soft, flattering shape with a similar brilliance to the round. It appears slightly larger per carat due to its stretched form — a popular choice for modern yet timeless rings.</p>\n      <img src=\"{{ 'oval.jpg' | asset_url }}\" alt=\"Oval Diamond\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Duplicate above blocks for more shapes as needed -->\n\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  document.querySelectorAll('.tab-header').forEach(header => {\n    header.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      const content = header.nextElementSibling;\n      header.classList.toggle('active');\n      content.style.display = content.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\n    });\n  });\n</script>"
      }
